      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/nelagoney_oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Early settlers in Nelagoney established a general store, a post office, and the community's first bank around the turn of the century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20,
        23,
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
